00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:21.330
Rafael  Belchior (INESC-ID): Align with what we thought.

94
00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:26.399
Rafael  Belchior (INESC-ID): But this provides, I think, a ground truth for our document to be created.

